{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0001","name":"诸葛丰","evidence":["zhuge-q-o001","wgc-q0022"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhuge-m-o001-zhuge-p0001","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o001"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o026-zhuge-p0001","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及诸葛丰","evidence":["wgc-q0022"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0022","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-12a13b8751046de2d4db","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛诞字公休，琅邪阳都人〖1〗。诸葛丰后也〖2〗。初以尚书郎为荥阳令。﹝一﹞入为吏部郎。人有所属托〖3〗，辄显其言而承用之；后有当否，则公议其得失以为褒贬：自是群僚莫不慎其所举。累迁御史中丞、尚书，与夏侯玄、邓飏等相善；收名朝廷，京都翕然〖4〗。言事者以诞、飏等修浮华，合虚誉，渐不可长。明帝恶之，免诞官。﹝二﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o001","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-7b233917c3cce526df35","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮字孔明，琅邪阳都人（也）〖1〗。汉司隶校尉诸葛丰后也。父珪，字君贡。汉末为太山郡丞。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
